{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8a0af71d76afd2d3bbf23d549f47e433b2a0d4a5555bdb0ae9f95e7a76d5bb8a","digest":{"component_or_area":"application-wide configuration and authentication composition framework (RP-04)","key_entities":["OperationSnapshot","RP-01","RP-04","ADR 0098","PydanticAIRunner","ProviderSession","check_config_reads.py","AST ownership gate","LLMRuntime","GitRuntime","BridgeRuntime","REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH","REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY","REBAR_ROOT","REBAR_OPERATION_SNAPSHOT_SHADOW","resolve_with_sources","SecretStr","SecretBytes"],"problem_keywords":["configuration composition","authentication","provider-native auth","operation-scoped","credential handling","environment precedence","static secrets","op-cert","immutable snapshots","ambient state"],"propositions":["Resolve one immutable, serializable OperationSnapshot at each operation boundary with explicit precedence: operation input > environment > project config > user config > schema default, without making Rebar a credential store.","Prevent mid-operation re-reading of ambient state (environment, files, cwd, global config) and composition inconsistency across LLM, Git, bridge, MCP, review-bot, observability, and op-cert boundaries.","Compose provider-native auth only through provider-specific, non-serializable carriers (Pydantic SecretStr/SecretBytes) revealed only in sending adapters; inject LLM auth exclusively through RP-01's ProviderSession builders.","Enforce op-cert startup validation accepting exactly REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH or REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY, copying to process-owned 0700 directory/0600 file, without runtime SSM/boto3/region coupling.","Isolate same-capability children with ambient environment inheritance while removing exact secret names declared by unrelated Rebar adapters; fail closed when explicit provider/profile/project/auth composition fails without anonymous or alternate-principal fallback.","Add portable-local-and-CI AST ownership gate deriving config/credential names from authoritative registries, rejecting reads/reloads/defaults below approved seams, permitting only exact path/symbol+rationale exceptions, and reaching zero legacy exceptions at cutover."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787159746737892001,"uuid":"8b0df0a5-f96e-40ac-aadb-7cea00c6cd82"}